stian_majority": "Catholicism, Seventh-day Adventist, Swedish Lutheranism, Pentecostal Assemblies of God",\n        "islam_minority": "Small Muslim population",\n        "syncretism": "Traditional religion + Christianity; continued consultation of omoragori",\n        "historical_photos": "Adventist school, Christian Gusii man c. 1916–1938"\n      }\n    }\n  },', 'community': 'kisii', 'section': 'section_8', 'relevance': 1.7418814897537231, 'source': 'Kisii.txt'}]}
